# Options for every Maven run in api/, including CI and the Docker build.
#
# Flyway's parent POM declares two extra repositories (GitHub Packages and Red Gate's feed). Maven would query
# both on every build and log a 401 warning for each. Every dependency comes from Maven Central, so they are
# blocked: Maven never contacts them and never accepts an artifact from them.
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.resolvePrefixFiles.flyway-community-db-support=false
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.noInputOutcome.flyway-community-db-support=false
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.resolvePrefixFiles.MavenFeed=false
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.noInputOutcome.MavenFeed=false
